--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c64463a8cfb05004786c9d008fce7188, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_15
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerName: Ichira
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c29da1097e5fea5d8638eba069b13ecd, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "Tr\xF4ng n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng th\u1EBF, Boum! H\xF4m nay l\u1EA1i
      t\xF2 m\xF2 kh\xE1m ph\xE1 m\xF3n g\xEC \u1EDF ti\u1EC7m c\u1EE7a c\xF4 \xE0?"
  - speakerName: Boum
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c29da1097e5fea5d8638eba069b13ecd, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "Ch\xE1u th\xEDch l\u1EAFm c\xF4 Ichira \u01A1i! Nh\u01B0ng m\u1EB9 c\u1EE9
      m\u1EAFng ch\xE1u hay b\u1EA5t c\u1EA9n, kh\xF4ng ch\u1ECBu nh\xECn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      ng\xF3 sau v\xE0 mau ch\xE1n qu\xE1..."
  - speakerName: Ichira
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c29da1097e5fea5d8638eba069b13ecd, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "T\xEDnh t\xF2 m\xF2 l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC3m tuy\u1EC7t v\u1EDDi, ch\u1EC9
      c\u1EA7n con bi\u1EBFt h\u01B0\u1EDBng n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\xF3
      \u0111\xFAng ch\u1ED7 th\xF4i. C\xF4 t\u1EB7ng con m\xF3n n\xE0y nh\xE9.\n(\u0110\u01B0a
      k\xEDnh thi\xEAn v\u0103n \u0111\u1ED3 ch\u01A1i v\xE0 s\u1ED5 tay)"
  - speakerName: Boum
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c29da1097e5fea5d8638eba069b13ecd, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "\u1ED2, k\xEDnh thi\xEAn v\u0103n v\u1EDBi s\u1ED5 tay ghi ch\xE9p! Ch\xE1u
      s\u1EBD t\u1EADp quan s\xE1t th\u1EADt k\u1EF9 m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9!"
